cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software artifact when referring to its checked Lean statements.
  Consult formalization/COVERAGE.md for the distinction between the formalized results and
  the paper linked below.
type: software
title: >-
  It Takes Two Moments: Rigidity and Limits of Continuous Encoders for
  Over-the-Air Computation — Lean formalization
authors:
  - family-names: Razavikia
    given-names: Saeed
version: 0.5.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization accompanying It Takes Two Moments: Rigidity and Limits
  of Continuous Encoders for Over-the-Air Computation. The artifact includes
  checked results on operational
  scores, heterogeneous continuous-encoder rigidity, general SDP attainment,
  Gaussian statistical limits, certified grid approximation, decoding, and
  Gram frontiers. The coverage documents state the exact manuscript correspondence.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - over-the-air computation
  - analog encoders
